---
title: Marinated Olives
prepTime: 5 min
totalTime: 5 min
difficulty: Easy
Rating: 8/10
description: The Chippewa Inn, Hayward, WI
source: Wisconsin Supper Clubs Cookbook
tags: Appetizer, Vegetables
---

> Note: Oil will set up if kept in the fridge after a few days.

Drain juice from the jar of @green olives{16%oz}.

Mix the @olive oil{1/4%cup}, @balsamic vinegar{1%tbsp}, @garlic{2%cloves}(minced),
@sugar{1%tsp}, @dried oregano{1/2%tsp}, @dried basil{1/2%tsp}, @red pepper flakes{1/8%tsp}, 
and @black pepper{dash} in a bowl and pour into the jar of olives.

Rotate "every now and then" to marinate the olives.
